# Supabase — copy to .env.local and fill in from your project's Settings → API
# page. Without these the app runs against a local store with no sign-in, which
# is how it can be run and reviewed before the project exists.
#
# Both values are publishable and ship in the browser bundle; row-level security
# is what protects the data. Never put the service_role key here.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
